# CHANGELOG

## [0.2.0] - 2026-04-07

### Added

- Vault open via native OS folder picker (`tauri-plugin-dialog`).
- Vault path persisted across restarts in `~/.config/lumen/vault.toml`.
- Zustand vault store (tree, active path, async load state).
- File tree sidebar: collapsible folders, `.md`-only, dirs-first sort.
- Inline F2 rename with collision detection.
- Delete key with confirmation prompt.
- New file button: creates empty `.md` at vault root.

### Fixed

- `dirs::config_local_dir` unwrap replaced with explicit error in minimal WSL envs.
- Remembered vault path silently discarded if directory no longer exists.
- Rename command rejects target filename that already exists.
- New file defaults to vault root when no folder context is available.
- Vault picker cancel no longer triggers `open_vault`.
- File tree loaded before transitioning to Screen 02 (no empty sidebar flash).
- Sidebar uses `flex-shrink: 0;` to prevent content area overflow collapsing it.

## [0.1.0] - 2026-04-06

### Added

- Tauri 2 + React 18 + TypeScript scaffold (`pnpm tauri dev` opens WSLg window).
- Design tokens integrated into app entry point (`tokens.css` imported in `main.tsx`).
- Vitest + React Testing Library configured.
- GitHub Actions CI: TypeScript check, React tests, Rust tests, clippy on every push.
- GitHub Actions Realease: AppImage + .deb built on tag push.
- Token sync lint script (`scripts/lint-tokens.sh`) added to CI.

### Fixed

- Dark mode `--shadow-palette` override missing from `tokens.css` (ECH D2).
- Dark accent hex corrected to `#5b9fe0` to match spce (ECH D1),
